{"seq":3,"slug":"terrain-performance","title":"地形性能预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/practice/terrain-performance","wordCount":1366,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"地形性能预算\">地形性能预算</h1><p>地形是整帧里最容易&quot;温水煮青蛙&quot;的开销——它不会像某个特效一样突然吃掉 5 毫秒让你警觉，而是几何、纹理、植被、流送、碰撞各悄悄占掉一点，加起来吃掉一帧的三分之一你都未必看得出元凶在哪。做地形性能必须把它当成一份<strong>预算</strong>来管：先知道每一项该花多少、实际花了多少、超在哪，再有的放矢地砍。这一篇把地形开销拆进四个预算维度，给出定位瓶颈与压缩超支的具体手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四个预算维度\">核心概念：四个预算维度</h2><p>地形开销不是一个数字，而是分布在四条相互独立、各有上限的预算线上。任何一条爆了都会掉帧，而且爆的那条决定了你该用哪类手段——拿优化几何的招去治显存超支是徒劳的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[地形总开销] --&gt; B[CPU 预算&lt;br/&gt;剔除/LOD选择/流送调度]&#10;    A --&gt; C[GPU 预算&lt;br/&gt;三角形/着色/overdraw]&#10;    A --&gt; D[显存预算&lt;br/&gt;高度场/纹理/VT缓存]&#10;    A --&gt; E[IO 带宽预算&lt;br/&gt;流送读盘/解压]&#10;    B --&gt; F[超支→GPU驱动剔除/合批]&#10;    C --&gt; G[超支→降LOD/减植被/RVT]&#10;    D --&gt; H[超支→虚拟纹理/压缩]&#10;    E --&gt; I[超支→预取/砖块尺寸/压缩格式]\">flowchart TD\n    A[地形总开销] --&gt; B[CPU 预算&lt;br/&gt;剔除/LOD选择/流送调度]\n    A --&gt; C[GPU 预算&lt;br/&gt;三角形/着色/overdraw]\n    A --&gt; D[显存预算&lt;br/&gt;高度场/纹理/VT缓存]\n    A --&gt; E[IO 带宽预算&lt;br/&gt;流送读盘/解压]\n    B --&gt; F[超支→GPU驱动剔除/合批]\n    C --&gt; G[超支→降LOD/减植被/RVT]\n    D --&gt; H[超支→虚拟纹理/压缩]\n    E --&gt; I[超支→预取/砖块尺寸/压缩格式]</pre><p>下表给出一个大世界开放地形在 16.6ms（60fps）预算下，地形各子系统的典型占比量级，用作排查时的&quot;合理范围&quot;参照——具体数字随项目与平台浮动，关键是知道哪项偏离了量级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子系统</th>\n<th>典型占用</th>\n<th>主要预算线</th>\n<th>失控信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地形几何（LOD 网格）</td>\n<td>1–3 ms</td>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>远景三角形过密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地表着色（混合/RVT）</td>\n<td>1–2 ms</td>\n<td>GPU 带宽</td>\n<td>每像素层数过多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>植被</td>\n<td>2–5 ms</td>\n<td>GPU（overdraw）</td>\n<td>草 overdraw 失控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流送调度</td>\n<td>&lt; 1 ms（异步）</td>\n<td>IO 带宽</td>\n<td>主线程挂载尖峰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碰撞查询</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.5 ms</td>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>NPC 用三角网碰撞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"先测后改-定位瓶颈是哪条预算线\">先测后改：定位瓶颈是哪条预算线</h2><p>不测就优化是地形性能的头号陷阱。先用 GPU 计时器与帧捕获工具（RenderDoc、PIX、UE Insights）把地形各 pass 的耗时拆开，判断到底是 GPU 还是 CPU 受限：若 GPU 忙满而 CPU 空闲，问题在几何/着色/植被；若 CPU 提交端是瓶颈，问题在 draw call 数量或流送调度。这套&quot;先 profile 定位再针对性优化&quot;的方法论是通用的，详见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/foundations/profiling-methodology\">性能优化 · profiling 方法论</a>，本节只谈地形特有的读数解释。</p>\n<p>GPU 受限时还要分辨是<strong>顶点端</strong>（三角形太多，常因 LOD 阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 设太激进或远景细分过密）、<strong>像素端</strong>（overdraw/着色太重，常因植被或多层混合），还是<strong>带宽端</strong>（纹理采样太多，靠虚拟纹理治）。三者对应完全不同的招，错判会白费功夫。</p>\n<h2 id=\"几何与着色-把三角形和采样压回去\">几何与着色：把三角形和采样压回去</h2><p><strong>几何超支</strong>（顶点端瓶颈）的根治手段是 LOD 调参与 GPU 驱动剔除。把 <a href=\"../lod/quadtree-lod\">四叉树 LOD</a> 的细分阈值收紧，让远景三角形密度匹配其屏幕尺寸；可见三角形数与开销近似线性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>visible</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>block</mtext></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>screen</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>block</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>target-px</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{visible}} \\approx \\sum_{\\text{block}} \\frac{A_{\\text{screen}}(\\text{block})}{a_{\\text{target-px}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">visible</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7291em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target-px</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">screen</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">block</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>让每个三角形在屏幕上占的目标像素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mtext>target-px</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{\\text{target-px}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target-px</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不要太小（小于一两像素就纯属浪费）。把剔除与 LOD 选择搬到 GPU compute、用间接绘制，能同时缓解 CPU 与 GPU。</p>\n<p><strong>着色超支</strong>（像素/带宽端）则靠 <a href=\"../shading/virtual-texturing-terrain\">虚拟纹理 RVT</a>：把每像素十几层混合塌缩成一次 RVT 采样，是地表着色带宽的最大单点优化。此外减少 splat 层数、对远景关闭三平面映射、把高频细节贴图按距离淡出，都直接削减采样数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"植被-流送与显存-最易失控的三处\">植被、流送与显存：最易失控的三处</h2><p><strong>植被</strong>几乎总是大世界 GPU 预算里最容易爆的一项，因为草的 overdraw 不直观。压制手段在 <a href=\"../shading/vegetation-scattering\">植被散布与渲染</a> 已展开：远景 Impostor、远草并入地表 albedo、距离密度淡出、GPU 剔除。一个实操要点是用 overdraw 可视化模式直接看哪片草在疯狂重绘。</p>\n<p><strong>流送</strong>的预算不在每帧渲染而在不卡顿——它本应是异步的，但主线程挂载若不限量就会偶发尖峰。纪律已在 <a href=\"../lod/terrain-streaming\">大世界分块流送</a> 给出：每帧限定挂载块数与耗时配额、延迟卸载防抖动、按 IO 带宽调砖块尺寸与压缩格式（如纹理用 BCn/ASTC、高度图用专用压缩）。</p>\n<p><strong>显存</strong>是硬墙——超了不是掉帧而是崩溃或被迫换出造成卡顿。地形显存大头是覆盖纹理与高度场，根治靠虚拟纹理（驻留只与可见页数相关）与积极的纹理压缩。把显存占用纳入持续监控，比事后排查崩溃划算得多——这与 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/memory-management\">性能优化 · 内存管理</a> 是同一套纪律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>把地形当预算管：开销分布在 CPU、GPU、显存、IO 带宽四条独立预算线上，爆哪条决定了用哪类手段。</li>\n<li>先 profile 定位再优化；GPU 受限还要分辨顶点端/像素端/带宽端，三者对应完全不同的招。</li>\n<li>几何超支靠收紧 LOD 阈值 + GPU 驱动剔除，让每三角形不小于一两像素；着色超支靠 RVT 把多层混合塌缩成单次采样。</li>\n<li>植被是最易失控项（overdraw），靠 Impostor、远草并入地表、距离密度淡出压制。</li>\n<li>流送预算的目标是不卡顿（限量挂载 + 延迟卸载 + 压缩格式）；显存是硬墙，靠虚拟纹理与压缩并持续监控。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章相关：<a href=\"terrain-authoring\">地形编辑与制作</a> 与 <a href=\"terrain-collision\">地形碰撞与物理</a> 的开销也计入此预算。</li>\n<li>各子系统的优化细节：<a href=\"../lod/quadtree-lod\">四叉树 LOD</a>、<a href=\"../shading/virtual-texturing-terrain\">虚拟纹理</a>、<a href=\"../shading/vegetation-scattering\">植被散布与渲染</a>、<a href=\"../lod/terrain-streaming\">大世界分块流送</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/foundations/frame-budget\">性能优化 · 帧预算</a> 与 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/foundations/profiling-methodology\">profiling 方法论</a>——通用预算与测量框架。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地形性能预算","id":"地形性能预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四个预算维度","id":"核心概念-四个预算维度"},{"level":2,"text":"先测后改：定位瓶颈是哪条预算线","id":"先测后改-定位瓶颈是哪条预算线"},{"level":2,"text":"几何与着色：把三角形和采样压回去","id":"几何与着色-把三角形和采样压回去"},{"level":2,"text":"植被、流送与显存：最易失控的三处","id":"植被-流送与显存-最易失控的三处"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"地形碰撞与物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/practice/terrain-collision"},"next":null}